        "title": "Lower anon and free tier credit limits",
        "summary": "ANON and FREE usage limits reduced to 500 and 1,000 respectively in `CREDITS_USAGE_LIMITS` within `common/src/constants.ts`. Adjusts resource allocation for non-paid tiers. Applies to shared core constants.",
